    Special Summoned: You can add to your hand up to 2 different "Ragnaraika" cards
    of yours that are banished and/or in your Deck, except "Ragnaraika the Evil Seed",
    then banish 1 card from your hand, also you cannot Special Summon for the rest
    of this turn, except Insect, Plant, or Reptile monsters. You can only use this
    effect of "Ragnaraika the Evil Seed" once per turn.'
